      "body": "I was not able to reproduce a crash with your example, I've built with v1.5.5 (hash d8cdaa33fda8df955cc76ef58a280f68f4cd43fa)\n\n```\nCORE_EXTENSIONS=\"spatial\" make release\n```\n\nBuilt a sqllogictest:\n```sql\nstatement ok\nset custom_extension_repository = './build/release/repository';\n\nstatement ok\nLOAD spatial;\n\nstatement ok\nCREATE OR REPLACE TABLE fire (\n    ShooterId TEXT,\n    MunitionId TEXT\n);\n\nstatement ok\nINSERT INTO fire VALUES ('2074', '2062');\n\nstatement ok\nCREATE OR REPLACE TABLE Detonation (\n    ShooterId TEXT,\n    MunitionId TEXT,\n    Longitude DOUBLE,\n    Latitude DOUBLE\n);\n\nstatement ok\nCREATE OR REPLACE TABLE oparea (\n    name TEXT,\n    area TEXT\n);\n\nstatement ok\nINSERT INTO oparea (name, area)\nVALUES ('xxxx', 'POLYGON((80 40,90 40,85 35,85 40,80 40))');\n\nquery III\nSELECT\n    Detonation.Longitude,\n    Detonation.Latitude,\n    IFNULL((\n        SELECT FIRST(name)\n        FROM oparea\n        WHERE ST_Intersects(\n            ST_GeomFromText(area), \n            ST_Point(Detonation.Longitude, Detonation.Latitude)\n        )\n    ), 'Other') AS area_name\nFROM fire\nLEFT JOIN Detonation\n    ON fire.ShooterId = Detonation.ShooterId\n    AND fire.MunitionId = Detonation.MunitionId\nGROUP BY ALL;\n----\nNULL\tNULL\tOther\n```\n\nAnd also with the publicly distributed version of the `spatial` build (`INSTALL spatial;`) I wasn't able to get this to crash.\n",
